### Deliver: the happy path through the API gateway.
### Works with the VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client and Visual Studio.
@gateway = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Register a driver (starts off shift)
# @name driver
POST {{gateway}}/api/drivers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos",
  "phone": "+56 9 1234 5678",
  "vehicle": { "plate": "ABCD12", "type": "Van", "capacityKg": 800 }
}

### 2. Start the shift → Fleet publishes driver.available → Dispatch adds Carlos to its pool
POST {{gateway}}/api/drivers/{{driver.response.body.id}}/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{ "available": true }

### 3. Create a shipment → 201 right away; price and driver arrive asynchronously
# @name shipment
POST {{gateway}}/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: http-file-demo

{
  "customerId": "5f0c6a8e-3d1b-4c55-9d0e-2a4b7c9e1f00",
  "pickupAddress":   { "street": "Av. Providencia 1234", "city": "Santiago",     "postalCode": "7500000" },
  "deliveryAddress": { "street": "Calle Valparaíso 55",  "city": "Viña del Mar", "postalCode": "2520000" },
  "items": [
    { "description": "Books",  "quantity": 2, "unitWeightKg": 1.5 },
    { "description": "Laptop", "quantity": 1, "unitWeightKg": 2.25 }
  ]
}

### 4. Read it: run again after a second to watch price and status fill in (eventual consistency)
GET {{gateway}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.id}}

### 5. Dispatch's decision
GET {{gateway}}/api/dispatch/assignments/{{shipment.response.body.id}}

### 6. Lifecycle, driven by the driver
POST {{gateway}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.id}}/pickup

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.id}}/transit

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.id}}/deliver

### 7. An invalid transition → 409 problem details
POST {{gateway}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.id}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Changed my mind" }

### 8. Billing: price, invoice and payment attempts
GET {{gateway}}/api/billing/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.id}}/invoice

### 9. What the customer was told
GET {{gateway}}/api/notifications?shipmentId={{shipment.response.body.id}}

### 10. Reporting read model
GET {{gateway}}/api/analytics/shipments

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/analytics/deliveries

### 11. Drivers ready for work
GET {{gateway}}/api/drivers/available
